<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SWISS CUP QUARTERFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWISS CUP QUARTERFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Cup quarter-final results on Tuesday:</p>
<p>  Schaffhouse  1  Servette    0</p>
<p>  Fribourg     2  Lausanne    1 (after extra time)</p>
<p>  Carouge	0  Lucerne     6</p>
<p>  Sion	   5  St. Gallen  0</p>
<p>Semifinals to be played May 19.</p>
</text>
